{"code":"279570","name":"케이뱅크","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"은행","sector_desc":"예대마진 기반 금융. 금리 수준과 대손비용, 주주환원 정책(배당·자사주)이 핵심입니다.","desc":"동사는 2016년 설립, 같은 해 은행업 인가를 획득하고 2017년 대고객 영업을 시작한 국내 1호 인터넷전문은행임. 예적금, 생활통장 등 수신 상품과 비대면 신용대출, 주택담보대출 등 여신 상품을 제공하며, 업비트 실명인증, 증권연계계좌 등을 운영하고 있음. Open Ecosystem 전략을 통해 통신, 투자, 디지털자산 제휴 서비스를 확대, 디지털 금융 플랫폼으로 진화하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-16","n_days":152,"close":5230.0,"open":5150.0,"high":5310.0,"low":5150.0,"volume":430981,"amount":2254030630.0,"ret_1d":2.549,"gap":0.9804,"range_pct":3.0593,"ret_5":-0.759,"ret_20":-6.9395,"ret_60":-18.1534,"ret_120":-17.1157,"ret_250":null,"ma20":5375.5,"ma60":5599.1667,"ma120":5757.8333,"ma200":null,"close_vs_ma200":null,"close_vs_ma60":-6.5932,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":null,"slope_60":-37.165,"r2_60":0.5806,"slope_120":-22.2623,"r2_120":0.2658,"slope_250":null,"r2_250":null,"high52":9880.0,"low52":5080.0,"pos_52w":3.125,"dd_52w":-47.0648,"mdd_1y":-38.7755,"atr14_pct":2.6769,"vol_ann_60":25.401,"vol_avg20":465804.15,"vol_ratio20":0.9252,"vr5":0.549,"vr20":0.1649,"amount_avg5":2823497776.0,"amount_avg20":2497415710.5,"amount_avg60":4034142536.0,"obv_chg20":-64.3109,"turnover_20":2.2963,"pv_eff_20":-3.022,"rsi14":39.5922,"frgn_net_5":476057.0,"inst_net_5":43650.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.1173,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0108,"smart_net_5_pct":0.1281,"frgn_net_20":-133475.0,"inst_net_20":-399948.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0329,"inst_net_20_pct":-0.0986,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.1315,"frgn_net_60":2613851.0,"inst_net_60":-1521688.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.6443,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.3751,"smart_net_60_pct":0.2692,"frgn_net_120":4053872.0,"inst_net_120":18814709.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.9992,"inst_net_120_pct":4.6376,"smart_net_120_pct":5.6369,"foreign_ratio":1.81,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.69,"smart_buy_streak":2,"op_income_q":270.0,"op_margin_q":8.267,"op_qoq":-16.6667,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-61.3181,"rev_yoy":-7.5573,"op_trend_4q":17.6948,"fin_period":"202606","roe":3.83,"debt_ratio":1191.83,"per":22.84,"pbr":0.87,"